 "id": "benchmark/records/mhd-analytic-ballooning-first-stability",
 "type": "fyo:ComparisonRecord",
 "title": {
  "zh": "气球模第一稳定边界：**截断误差严格按 1/N 走，于是它能被外推掉**",
  "en": "The ballooning first-stability boundary: the truncation error goes exactly as 1/N, so it can be extrapolated away"
 },
 "domain": "mhd-analytic",
 "requirement": [
  "FR-EQ-018"
 ],
 "comparison_kind": "verification",
 "overall_verdict": "pass",
 "compared_subject": {
  "type": "spo:Code",
  "name": "fylite · `stability::balloon_shoot` / `balloon_alpha_c` / `balloon_alpha_c_extrapolated`",
  "comment": "2026-09-18 新写：s-α 气球模方程的打靶解"
 },
 "compared_reference": [
  {
   "type": "spo:InformationContentEntity",
   "name": "s-α 模型的教科书性质（Connor · Hastie · Taylor 1978）",
   "comment": "α = 0 必稳；第一稳定边界 $\\alpha_c(s)$ 随剪切单调升；大剪切端 $\\alpha_c\\approx0.6\\,s$。★这一格没有一个能到 1e-10 的闭式——判据给的是**性质与区间**，本条照它验。"
  }
 ],
 "criteria": [
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/mhd-analytic-ballooning-first-stability/criterion/1",
   "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
   "quantity_label": "α = 0 必稳（符号锚）",
   "norm": "identity",
   "tolerance_basis": "machine_precision"
  },
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/mhd-analytic-ballooning-first-stability/criterion/2",
   "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
   "quantity_label": "边界处打靶量为零且两侧异号",
   "norm": "identity",
   "tolerance_basis": "reference_self_reported"
  },
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/mhd-analytic-ballooning-first-stability/criterion/3",
   "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
   "quantity_label": "$\\alpha_c(s)$ 单调增，大剪切端 $\\alpha_c/s\\in(0.5,0.75)$",
   "norm": "identity",
   "tolerance_basis": "reference_self_reported"
  },
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/mhd-analytic-ballooning-first-stability/criterion/4",
   "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
   "quantity_label": "截断收敛（24 vs 32 差 < 1e-3），并**记明 16 不够**",
   "norm": "absolute",
   "tolerance": {
    "type": "spo:QuantityValue",
    "numeric_value": 0.001
   },
   "tolerance_basis": "reference_self_reported"
  },
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/mhd-analytic-ballooning-first-stability/criterion/5",
   "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
   "quantity_label": "域内无跨越时报错，不外推",
   "norm": "identity",
   "tolerance_basis": "reference_self_reported"
  }
 ],
 "findings": [
  {
   "type": "fyo:ComparisonFinding",
   "title": "★α = 0 时打靶量**精确**为 1",
   "criterion": "benchmark/records/mhd-analytic-ballooning-first-stability/criterion/1",
   "measured_deviation": 0.0,
   "bound": "identity",
   "deviation_literal": "$s$ = 0 · 0.3 · 1 · 2.5 · 5：$S(0)$ **逐位等于 1**",
   "verdict": "pass",
   "caveat": [
    "★α = 0 时方程退化为 $((1+s^2\\theta^2)F')'=0$，配上 $F'(0)=0$ 只剩 $F\\equiv1$——没有驱动就没有节点。验的是**精确的 1**，不是「接近 1」：一个在零驱动下仍有数值漂移的积分器，会在这里露馅。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "fyo:ComparisonFinding",
   "title": "★边界上打靶量为零、两侧异号",
   "criterion": "benchmark/records/mhd-analytic-ballooning-first-stability/criterion/2",
   "bound": "identity",
   "deviation_literal": "$s$ = 0.6 · 1 · 2 · 4：$S(\\alpha_c\\mp10^{-3}\\alpha_c)$ **正 / 负**，$|S(\\alpha_c)|$ < 1e-6 × 两侧量级",
   "verdict": "pass",
   "caveat": [
    "★打靶量取 $S(\\alpha)=F(\\theta_{max})$：无节点时为正，节点刚进入域内时变负——**所以它的零点就是 Newcomb 节点判据的边界**，不是另立的一个判据。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "fyo:ComparisonFinding",
   "title": "★★第一稳定边界随剪切单调升，$s=1$ 处 0.6086，大剪切端斜率 0.60 / 0.62",
   "criterion": "benchmark/records/mhd-analytic-ballooning-first-stability/criterion/3",
   "bound": "identity",
   "deviation_literal": "截断外推后 $\\alpha_c(s)$：$s$ = 0.4 · 0.6 · 1 · 1.5 · 2 · 3 · 4 → **0.35444 · 0.42453 · 0.60855 · 0.87750 · 1.17124 · 1.80573 · 2.48250**，严格单调升；$\\alpha_c/s$ 在 $s$ = 3 / 4 上 **0.602 / 0.621**（判据带 0.5–0.75）",
   "verdict": "pass",
   "caveat": [
    "★$s=1$ 处 0.6086 正是教科书 s-α 图上那一点（$\\approx0.6$）——**这是一个与实现无关的外部锚**，虽然只到两位。",
    "★$\\alpha_c/s$ **本身不单调**：0.886（$s$=0.4）→ 0.585（$s$=1.5）→ 0.621（$s$=4）——低剪切端边界弯起来，这是 s-α 第一稳定边界的已知形状。判据只约束大剪切端，所以只在那里验斜率。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "fyo:ComparisonFinding",
   "title": "★★截断误差严格 $\\propto 1/N$、从上方收敛——**而上游的「16 偏低」在这里是偏高**",
   "criterion": "benchmark/records/mhd-analytic-ballooning-first-stability/criterion/4",
   "measured_deviation": 0.0009826,
   "bound": "upper",
   "deviation_literal": "$s=1$、截断 $\\theta_{max}=N\\pi$：$N$ = 16 · 24 · 32 · 48 → **0.614450 · 0.612466 · 0.611484 · 0.610507**。逐段差除以 $\\Delta(1/N)$ = **0.0952 · 0.0943 · 0.0938**（彼此差 < 1.5 %）；Richardson 外推 (16,32) **0.608517**、(24,48) **0.608548**（差 3.1e-5）。判据字面 **24 vs 32 = 9.826e-4 < 1e-3**；★**16 对极限 +0.97 %**",
   "verdict": "pass",
   "caveat": [
    "★★**方向与判据写的相反，照实记**：判据说上游「16 不够，偏低 3.6 %」；本实现的 16 是**偏高 0.97 %**。原因是结构性的：真边界上节点在无穷远，有限 $\\theta_{max}$ 要等 α 再大一点、把节点拉进域内才看得见，所以 $\\alpha_c(N)>\\alpha_\\infty$。★**方向不同说明两边的「截断」不是同一个量**——上游的可能是基函数阶数或别的截断，这里无从得知。**不去凑那个 3.6 %**：凑出来的数就不再是测量。",
    "★★**1/N 律比「24 vs 32 < 1e-3」有用得多**：后者在这里只以 1.7 % 的余量通过，而且 32→48 同样动 ~1e-3——**单看两档之差不能说明收敛**。律一旦量准，Richardson 一阶消去就是对的那一阶，外推换一对 $N$ 只动 3e-5，这才是收敛的证据。",
    "★「记明 16 不够」这一条的实质照做了：16 的偏差被**断言**大于 0.5 %，并记明了方向。",
    "★步长不是瓶颈：每 π 100 / 200 / 400 步给 0.6114835896 / …879 / …878，200 步已收敛到 1e-9。**误差全在截断上**。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "fyo:ComparisonFinding",
   "title": "★域内无跨越时按名拒绝，扫得到时照常给数",
   "criterion": "benchmark/records/mhd-analytic-ballooning-first-stability/criterion/5",
   "bound": "identity",
   "deviation_literal": "$s=1$ 的边界在 0.61 附近：只扫到 0.5 → `BALLOON_NO_CROSSING`；扫到 1.0 → 照常给出",
   "verdict": "pass",
   "caveat": [
    "★一个在区间外「延长出来」的边界是编的。★第二半同样要验：拒绝要**精确**，一个见区间就拒的实现能过前一半。"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "validity_domain": "s-α 模型（圆截面、大环径比、局部）、偶模、Newcomb 节点判据。★**不含**形状效应、有限 $n$ 修正与第二稳定区——判据只问第一稳定边界。★截断 $\\theta_{max}=N\\pi$，每 π 200 步 RK4。",
 "caveat": [
  "★★**判决成立**：五格全过。第四格的字面（24 vs 32 < 1e-3）以薄余量通过，其实质（记明 16 不够）照做，**方向与上游相反且照实记**——本实现的截断从上方收敛，并以 1/N 律刻画到可外推的程度。",
  "★这是本域行文所说「尺」的第二格。**`mhd-analytic` 这一域到此清空**（`FR-EQ-017` · `FR-EQ-018` 都已入册）。",
  "★门在内核仓，本仓 CI 跑不到——与 `FR-EQ-017` 同一处代价；没有开门的理由也相同：交付面等 `FR-EQ-026`（判据点名气球模 `n_phi` 缺省留空、`growthrate` 留空）。"
 ],
